Further modifications:
 - arduino_*.svg: the board art is drawn rotated by 90 degrees and scaled in the code
   (src/gui/circuitwidget/partart.cpp) so that every header hole lands on its SimulIDE pin;
   a few header strips are moved at paint time for the same reason. The SVG files are
   otherwise unchanged. The Arduino name and logo that appear on the boards are trademarks of
   Arduino; they are part of the board artwork and are shown only to identify the board.
 - servo.svg: the three wires were removed and the view box cropped to the body (wires and
   the moving horn are drawn by the code).
 - glcd_128x64.svg: the 8192 pixel-grid rectangles and the demo bitmap were removed
   (1.8 MB -> 17 KB); the pixels are drawn by the component.
